{"id":"n7fbd6c33f0","headline":"US-Iran war: How the LPG cylinder has become the face of Middle East mayhem's impact on India","summary":"Rising LPG cylinder costs linked to the US-Iran war are hitting Indian households and small businesses. A tea stall vendor in Noida said the price of a cup of tea had risen to 15 rupees.","why":"LPG is a key cooking fuel in India and is largely imported, so Middle East supply disruptions pass quickly into household costs and inflation. Energy import costs also affect the rupee.","category":"commodities","event_type":"commodity-prices","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.614,"lon":77.209,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"The Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/us-iran-war-how-the-lpg-cylinder-has-become-the-face-of-middle-east-mayhems-impact-on-india/articleshow/129628323.cms"},"sources":[{"name":"The Times of India","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/india-business/us-iran-war-how-the-lpg-cylinder-has-become-the-face-of-middle-east-mayhems-impact-on-india/articleshow/129628323.cms"}],"published_at":"2026-03-17T11:08:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"c4946f3f1298eed8","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-03-17T11:08:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-03-17T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/gas-pipeline-514035.jpg","alt":"gas pipeline (illustration)","credit":"jp26jp","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photo